Spoiler:

















If you still have the wand of wishing, try zapping it again and again,
you will get another wish before it disintegrates.  It may take
several hundred zaps...
It seems you have to get some method to do a level teleport.
Teleport control is necessary to go to level 50.
A cursed teleport scroll or a level teleport trap will do the level teleport.
Try to go up and see if you can find a scroll. (Was there any bookstores?)
On some of the levels there is a teleport scroll hidden outside the wall of
one of the rooms.  There are no secret door, so you'll have to dig.
The scroll can be cursed by dipping it in unholy water, wich may be obtained
by dropping a potion of water on a chaotic altar.  A potion of water may be
obtained by dipping any other potion in water, several times if necessary.
A teleport scroll may also be obtained by polymorphing other scrolls.  Or
you could write one with a magic marker, assuming you have seen one before.

There may be another way to get down, too.  If you have some wands of digging,
or a pickaxe, perhaps you can dig through the floor.  (I have never tried this,
I don't know if the floor is too hard or not.)
You will probably meet the wizard before level 50 if this method works.
